{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Linksider is a puzzle game with simple yet challenging mechanics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413380/extras/gameplay1.gif?t=1744967780\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Side effects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The core mechanic are the <strong>&quot;Side Effects&quot;</strong> you attach to the sides of your character. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These effects interact with the environment in different ways, changing how the player navigates the levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By combining multiple effects in different ways you may find surprising solutions to the puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413380/extras/gameplay5.gif?t=1744967780\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Head-scratching puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reaching the goal in some levels can be quite tricky. Sometimes you need to go back in order to stop being stuck in a loop. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413380/extras/gameplay4.gif?t=1744967780\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Diverse levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has around 100 levels exploring the different mechanics, from jumping and sliding, to portals and manipulating gravity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413380/extras/gameplay3.gif?t=1744967780\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Award-winning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Linksider was originally made for and won the Bevy Game Jam #3.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3413380?t=1744967780","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3413380?t=1744967780","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413380/1d1f44fa9c626d848913750b5b7f7e7dd23cfe7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744967780","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413380/1d1f44fa9c626d848913750b5b7f7e7dd23cfe7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744967780","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Linksider is a puzzle game with simple yet challenging mechanics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413380/extras/gameplay1.gif?t=1744967780\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Side effects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The core mechanic are the <strong>&quot;Side Effects&quot;</strong> you attach to the sides of your character. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These effects interact with the environment in different ways, changing how the player navigates the levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By combining multiple effects in different ways you may find surprising solutions to the puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413380/extras/gameplay5.gif?t=1744967780\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Head-scratching puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reaching the goal in some levels can be quite tricky. Sometimes you need to go back in order to stop being stuck in a loop. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413380/extras/gameplay4.gif?t=1744967780\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Diverse levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has around 100 levels exploring the different mechanics, from jumping and sliding, to portals and manipulating gravity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413380/extras/gameplay3.gif?t=1744967780\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Award-winning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Linksider was originally made for and won the Bevy Game Jam #3.</p>","developers":["Daivy","Kuviman","Vesdev"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2995150","name":"Linksider"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413380/header.jpg?t=1744967780","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 3000</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257127642,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127642/movie480.mp4?t=1744967778","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127642/movie_max.mp4?t=1744967778"},"name":"gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257127642/55ebd8d3db9c8c9fa38ad9c5b7cd32d2aa1bbb47/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744967778","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127642/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744967778","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127642/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744967778"}}],"name":"Linksider Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 3000</li></ul>"},"platforms":